=== N8. Proposition N11 (flat model): radial reduction r = r(s) and the trace equation   [450 s]
  [ 41] radial r = f(s) on the flat model: f' = 2 c mu_1 b f and f'' = mu_1 b c f are compatible iff (2 c mu_1 b)^2 = mu_1 b c, i.e. lambda in [1/5, 13/56]; at lambda = 1/5 (b = 0) f' = 0, so f is constant; at 13/56, f = C e^(s/2): True
  [ 42] lambda = 13/56, r = C e^(s/2): r (trace equation) is a polynomial in r with constant term 14 A = 13/(19267584*N**3) != 0, so the trace equation fails on every interval of s: True

